  2++ 6806              ; PROJECT126 — ATM-side TR-DOS directory browser
  3++ 6806              ; Reads the native TR-DOS catalogue and allows cursor navigation.
  4++ 6806              ; The directory is read from track 0 into the page-0 buffer at #C800.
  5++ 6806              ; =========================================================================
